# Build output (_book) is VENDORED: the pre-commit hook (.githooks/pre-commit)
# rebuilds it from app/ via `bun run build` and stages it, so the Docker image
# packs committed HTML. Do not ignore _book.
# LaTeX intermediates from PDF rendering
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out
